::kind(writ)

=[ Writ: unclassified fixture ]

==[ crate-layering ]

Every workspace member belongs to exactly one layer.

@rule(crate-layering){
  guard: { twrit: layers }

  layers: {
    0: list("covered")
  }
}

`stray` is a member and appears in no layer. This is the half of the rule
that catches a rule never written, rather than one broken.
